  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Musahid Ahmed Masgul Ahmad Shaikh vs State Of Maharashtra on 30 March, 2026 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Criminal Application No.542 Of 2026 Musahid Ahmed Masgul Ahmad Shaikh ... Applicant V/s. State Of Maharashtra ... Respondent _______________________________ _ _ _ __ Mr. Tuushar Sonawane, Advocate for the Applicant. Mrs. Poonam Bhosale, App for the State. Sharada Psi Y. G. Marathe, Alibaugh Police Station, Raigad, is present. Rangnath Wahule ____________________________________ Digitally signed by Sharada Rangnath Wahule Date: 2026.03.31 16:56:59 +0530 Coram : Ashwin D. Bhobe, J. Dated : 30th March 2026 P.C.: 1. Heard Mr. Tuushar Sonawane, learned Advocate for the Applicannt and Mrs. Poonam Bhosale, learned App for the Respondent- State.",
    "facts": "2. By the present Application, the Applicant herein / accused seeking to quash & set quash the FIR in Crime No.273 of2020 registered Kandivali Police Station, Mumbai (now transferred to Crime Branch Uni-11 Mumbai Division, Kandivali (West) as Crime No.92 of 2020) for the offence punishable under section 420, 328, 279, 273, 179, 188, 120B of I.P.C. and section: 26(2) (1), 27(2)4, 27(3), 3(1)(z)(3), 59 of Food Safety and Standards Act dated 11 th May 2020 with 2, 3, 4, of the Epidemic Act, 1897 with Charge sheet dated 27th July, 2021 and Case Sharada 2-APL-542-2026.doc bearing Sessions Case No.100947 of 2021 pending before the Ld. City Civil and Sessions Court Mumbai. He refers to the orders passed in the above said Petitions, wherein this Court has admitted the same and granted interim reliefs.",
    "arguments": "3. Mr. Tuushar Sonawane, learned Advocate for the Applicant submits that the issue involved in the present Application is pending for consideration before the Hon'ble Supreme Court. 4. Mrs. Poonam Bhosale, learned APP for the Respondent-State does not dispute that the issue involved in the present Application is subject matter of the Petitions, referred by the Applicant in the present Application. She submits that the present Application filed under Section 528 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sannhita, 2023 (for short \"BNSS\") be tagged along with the aforesaid Petitions and other connected matters.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. Mr. Tuushar Sonawane, learned Advocate for the Applicant submits that the issue involved in the present Application is pending for consideration before the Hon'ble Supreme Court. 4. Mrs. Poonam Bhosale, learned APP for the Respondent-State does not dispute that the issue involved in the present Application is subject matter of the Petitions, referred by the Applicant in the present Application. She submits that the present Application filed under Section 528 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sannhita, 2023 (for short \"BNSS\") be tagged along with the aforesaid Petitions and other connected matters.",
